From 76b5c592b1719315dd4dc2928d5e8c0bbcf2b3f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:06:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] a read-back item, a question's counted words and a node's
 kind bucket are reached with nothing minted per probe

The held items' cache keys by a ContentHash folded from the item's file,
place and print; a question's counted prefix is minted once per query,
its bytes and so its identity unchanged; an arena's kind buckets are
probed by the tag's own word.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QBqJunZcEyAdXLmQJftdiw
